00:03:11.967 --> 00:03:13.840
<v Host>It means management.

00:03:14.439 --> 00:03:24.639
<v Slow>漏れたおそれがあるのは、最大でおよそ643万件の会員の情報です。

00:03:25.439 --> 00:03:29.879
<v Host>Up to about six point four three million member records may have leaked.

00:03:30.479 --> 00:03:32.783
