00:03:33.183 --> 00:03:35.800
<v Host>It means maximum, or up to.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:47.536
<v Slow>名前や生年月日、性別、住所、電話番号、メールアドレスなどが含まれています。

00:03:48.336 --> 00:03:55.439
<v Host>This includes names, birth dates, gender, addresses, phone numbers, and email addresses.

00:03:56.039 --> 00:03:58.536
