00:04:44.536 --> 00:04:46.456
<v Host>It means on the other hand.

00:04:47.055 --> 00:04:54.255
<v Slow>会社が不正アクセスに気づいたのは、今月6日でした。

00:04:55.055 --> 00:04:59.855
<v Host>The company noticed the unauthorized access on the sixth of this month.

00:05:00.456 --> 00:05:02.711
