00:06:31.432 --> 00:06:33.327
<v Host>It means suspicious.

00:06:33.927 --> 00:06:44.487
<v Slow>最近、日本では企業への不正アクセスが相次いでいて、対策が急がれています。

00:06:45.288 --> 00:06:51.192
<v Host>Cyberattacks on Japanese companies keep happening, and countermeasures are urgently needed.

00:06:51.791 --> 00:06:54.096
